# Tendril of the Mycotyrant: "{5}{G}{G}: Put seven +1/+1 counters on target noncreature land you control. It becomes a 0/0 Fungus creature with
# haste. It's still a land." Bot1 targets its Mutavault, then in response taps the Mutavault for {C} and makes it a 2/2 creature. As the
# Tendril's ability resolves its one target is no longer a noncreature land, so the ability does nothing (CR 608.2b): no counters, and on
# Bot2's turn the Mutavault is a land only again.

